#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/light_carriers.lua:17
msgid ""
"The Ryder is a large carrier spacecraft with many defensive features "
"deployed by the Exuari. It can be docked by smaller ships to refuel or carry "
"them. Unlike a station it is equipped with a slow impulse drive and capable "
"of interstellar travel. It is used as a habitation for Exuari crews and has "
"a hangar bay. A commom Exuari assault strategy is to keep a Ryder off the "
"sensor range of the desired target, while fighters and artillery start from "
"the carrier."
msgstr ""

