#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/light_carriers.lua:67
msgid ""
"The Exuari Fortress is a huge carrier with many defensive features deployed "
"by the Exuari. It can be docked by smaller ships to refuel or carry them, "
"and is equipped with a slow impulse drive. The shields of this base carrier "
"are believed to be impenetrable."
msgstr ""
